Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（特别放送）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:13.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿州 西雅图）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:13.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密歇根州 伊普西兰蒂）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:25.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现今）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:30.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到圣诞老人村）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内布拉斯加州 布罗肯鲍）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:26.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1991年平安夜）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也圣诞快乐 史蒂文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas to you, Stevey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我带礼物来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring me any presents?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要带礼物来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would I wanna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天是圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节带礼物来的不是圣诞老人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Santa Claus brought the presents at Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今年是个乖孩子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been a good boy this year, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.39,0:00:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好啊 谁知道呢 或许他会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then. Who knows? Maybe he'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,驯鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿和我当时在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter and I were in our beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克在楼下装饰圣诞树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike was downstairs decorating the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到屋顶传来一记重响\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I heard a thump on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我听到了迈克尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I heard Mike scream…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我在接受联调局的询问\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I'm talking to the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都没看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see any of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he was…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.65,0:02:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,门锁着 也没有强行闯入的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doors were locked, there was no forced entry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人有钥匙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody else have a key?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们住哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do they live?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗里达州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你让我到处看看 沃什太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for letting me have a look, Mrs Walsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们已得到了我们需要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got just about everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会再联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方说我丈夫可能是被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police said my husband might've been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绑匪怎么还不来电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why haven't the kidnappers called?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,或索要赎金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or demanded a ransom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有三天就圣诞节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's three days until Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么跟我们女儿说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to tell our daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,长袜 槲寄生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stockings, mistletoe,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tooth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 在哪发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Where was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟囱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟囱 一个男人不可能钻进烟囱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chimney? No way a man fits up a chimney,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太窄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个完整的人进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way he fits up in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果爸爸是顺烟囱上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So if dad went up the chimney…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到把他拽上去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find out what dragged him up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是对的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.14,0:04:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是连环杀人扫烟囱工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it the serial killing chimney sweep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 其实是迪克·范·戴克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, it's actually Dick Van Dyke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽·波平斯 - 那又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary Poppins… - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来 沃什是本月镇上第二个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, turns out, that Walsh is the second guy in twon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,被从家里抓走的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}grabbed out of his house this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个人也是被从烟囱拽上去的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the other guy get dragged up the chimney too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 目击者只说听到屋顶传来重响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Witnesses said they heard a thump on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这是个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what the hell you think we are dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我有个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去会很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna sound crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么会让我觉得疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly say that sounds crazy to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,每种文化里都有某种反圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's some version of the Anti-Claus in every culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝尔斯尼克 克朗普斯 黑彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got Belsnickel, Krampus, Black Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么称呼它 有各种相关传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you wanna call it. There's all sorts of lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想当年 圣诞老人的弟弟变坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying, back in the day, Santa's brother went rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他会在圣诞节时出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he shows up around Christmas time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不带来礼物 而是惩罚坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but instead of bringing presents, he punishes the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们拽上烟囱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By hauling their ass up chimneys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个开头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的理论吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is your theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人的坏弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa's shady brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…就是说 这是传说的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I… Just saying, that's what the lore says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人没有弟弟 根本没有圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa doesn't have a brother. There is no Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初还是你告诉我的呢 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who told me that in the first place, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我可能错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what, I could be wrong, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查了查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a little digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来两名受害人被抓前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out, both victims visited the same place,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,都去过同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they got snatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让理论有点可信度了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does kind of lend credence to the theory, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但反圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Anti-Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是圣诞奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Christmas miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 我们今年该过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of, we should have one this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过一次什么 - 圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have one what? - A Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们弄棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we'll get a tree…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,买点快餐回来 就像我们小时候那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little Boston Market, just like when we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 小时候的记忆对我来说没那么温馨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, those weren't exactly Hallmark memories for me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 我当年有些圣诞节很棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you talking about? We had some great Christmases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是谁的童年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's childhood are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 圣诞怪杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, grinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给爸爸的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present for dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪来的钱 偷的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get the money? Steal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲍比叔叔给我送他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Bobby gave it to me to give to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说它很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said it was real special.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.39,0:06:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小马\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸会回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's gonna be here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.69,0:06:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这可是圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:06:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll be here. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.99,0:07:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,办事去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of business?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他卖东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sells stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不肯告诉我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody ever tells me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then quit asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸是间谍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is dad a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.89,0:07:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是007\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么老搬家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we move around so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不管我们去哪 人们都会厌烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because everywhere we go, they get sick of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我够大了 迪恩 你可以告诉我实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old enough, Dean. You can tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想知道实情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才从不谈起妈妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why we never talk about mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.49,0:07:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不许提起妈妈 永远不许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever talk about mom, ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了10块才进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think for the 10 bucks it costs to get into this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人也不弄点雪出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa could scrounge up a little snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我们要找什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. What are we looking for again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据传说 反圣诞老人走路跛脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lore says that the Anti-Claus will walk with a limp…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还一身甜味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and smell like sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我们要找个皮条客圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, so we're looking for a pimp Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有甜味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 迪恩 如果你一身糖味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it, Dean. If you smell like candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子会乐意靠近你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kids will come closer, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真瘆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意怎么知道谁乖谁不乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does this thing know who's been naughty and who's been nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼 来坐在圣诞老人膝盖上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Ronny, come sit on Santa's knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.47,0:08:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今年乖不乖 - 乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been a good boy this year? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人有特别礼物给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa's got a special gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到圣诞老人之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Santa's Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我带你们的孩子去见圣诞老人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I escort your child to Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实 我弟弟这辈子一直想见圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But actually, my brother here, it's been a lifelong dream of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 仅限12岁以下儿童 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No kids over 12. - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是来看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only came here to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean that we came here to…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了 迪恩 多谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot, Dean. Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人走路跛脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people walk with limps, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没闻到吗 那是糖果味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you didn't smell that? That was candy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是果酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was ripple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是吧 肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think. Had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧 我们要冒险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. We're willing to take that chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你上次问时没变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as the last time you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caffeinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么成了个讨厌圣诞节的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you the boy that hates Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.41,0:10:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小时候有些节日不怎么平顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we had a few bumpy holidays when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不平顺 - 但那是那时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bumpy? - But that was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今年好好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it right this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 如果你想过圣诞节 请便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, if you wanna have Christmas, knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扯上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't involve me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那肯定好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己做酸梅糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and myself making cranberry molds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with Saint Nicotine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一心要过圣诞节的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, Mr. Gung-Ho Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能要崩了圣诞老人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}might have to blow away a Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不感兴趣 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really not interested, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,揉我的脚趾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistle my toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸我的胸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roast my chestnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇我的铃铛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jingle my bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,*平安夜*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Silent night*
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,*圣善夜*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Holy night*
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,*真宁静*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*All is calm*
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:12:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,*真光明*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*All is bright*
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.87,0:12:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- *光明…* - *圣光…*\N{\fnArial\fs30}- *Bright…* - *Round…*
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人 你来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa, you're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子是这样描述袭击的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's how your son described the attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人把爸爸拽上了烟囱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa took daddy up the chimney?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he says, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔就尖叫着被从床上拽了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al was being dragged out of bed, screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到袭击者了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the attacker?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时太黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打晕了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knocked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我知道这很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I know this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.03,0:14:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,考德威尔太太 壁炉上那个花环你哪买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Caldwell, where did you get that wreath above the fireplace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just curious, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,花环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wreaths, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不问问她哪买的鞋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you didn't wanna ask her about her shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在门厅里看到了不错的手包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw some nice handbags in the foyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们见过那个花环 迪恩 - 在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've seen that wreath before, Dean. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃什家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Walsh's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我就试你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I was just testing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那麻烦你继续查吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep looking, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要对付的不是反圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not dealing with the Anti-Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Bobby say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we're morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还说 花环里的可能是绣线菊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also said that it was probably meadowsweet in those wreaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.30,0:15:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,绣线菊是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is meadowsweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很稀有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且可能是异教传说里最强大的植物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's probably the most powerful plant in pagan lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.47,0:15:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,异教传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pagan lore?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.81,0:15:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用绣线菊做人祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, they'd use meadowsweet for human sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像给他们神的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was kind of like a chum for their gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,神被它吸引 他们便会来做客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods were drawn to it, and they'd stop by and.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.61,0:15:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,并吃掉最近的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}snack on whatever was the nearest human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会有人用那个做圣诞节花环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would somebody be using that for Christmas wreaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不像听上去那么离谱 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not as crazy as it sounds, Dean. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节传统基本上都是异教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty much every Christmas tradition is pagan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节是耶稣的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas is Jesus' birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 耶稣的生日八成是在秋季\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jesus' birthday was probably in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是冬至节\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was actually the winter solstice festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,被教会改成了圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was co-opted by the Church and renamed Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但圣诞柴 圣诞树 甚至圣诞老人的红装\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I mean, the yule log, the tree, even Santa's red suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是异教崇拜遗留下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all remnants of pagan worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接下来还要说什么 复活节兔子是犹太教的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you tell me next? Easter bunny's Jewish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这是个异教神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think we're dealing with a pagan god?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 可能是霍根尼卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, probably Holdenacar…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬至之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}god of the winter solstice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果那些家装迷买了些高档花环回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all these Martha Stewart wannabes buying these fancy wreaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 差不多就像在家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, it's pretty much like putting a neon sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂了块霓虹灯牌 写着「来杀我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}on your front door saying: "Come kill us."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,向霍根尼卡做人祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you sacrifice to Holdenacar,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.57,0:16:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜你能得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}guess what he gives you in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望是大腿舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lap dances, hopefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,温和天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mild weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像密歇根州中部大12月的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda like no snow in the middle of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不下雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the middle of Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道怎么杀它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we know how to kill it, yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 鲍比在查呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bobby's working on that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得查到花环是哪卖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta figure out where they're selling those wreaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是有人故意在卖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think they're selling them on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这玩意投食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeding the victims to this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们查查看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么我能帮你们的吗 - 希望有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I help you, boys? - I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那天晚上去沃什家玩层层叠\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were playing Jenga over at the Walsh's the other night and…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他此后便一直张口闭口都是那个圣诞花环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he hasn't shut up since about this Christmas wreath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不清楚 你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. You tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太香了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖过很多花环\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sell a lot of wreaths, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right, but you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}this one would have been really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有绿叶 白芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had… It had green leaves, white buds on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是用绣线菊做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might have been made of meadowsweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真挑剔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you a fussy one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 我知道你指的是哪个 我卖光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I know the one you're talking about. I'm all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这绣线菊什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, seems like this meadowsweet stuff's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:17:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很稀有又昂贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty rare and expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会用它来做花环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why make wreaths out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 不是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me. I didn't make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位本地女士 玛姬·卡里根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madge Carrigan, a local lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说这花环很特别 免费送给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said the wreaths were so special, she gave them to me for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没收你钱吗 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She didn't charge you. - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也免费送了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sell them for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没 现在是圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no. It's Christmas…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们愿为这破玩意付大钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}people pay a butt-load for this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是圣诞精神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得绣线菊花环得要多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you think a meadowsweet wreath would cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少几百\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple hundred dollars, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女人免费送出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This lady's giving them away for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd say it's pretty suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得爸爸有一年拿回家来的那个花环吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that wreath Dad brought home that one year?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从一家酒水店偷回来的那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, the one he stole from, like, a liquor store?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 一堆空啤酒罐做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was a bunch of empty beer cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我敢说如果我好好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I bet if I looked around hard enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到个一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could probably find one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:55.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,你怎么化身唱《白色圣诞节》的平·克劳斯贝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, since when are you Bing Crosby all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么想过圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you wanna do Christmas so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.71,0:19:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you so against it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的童年记忆就那么惨烈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, were your childhood memories that traumatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 跟那无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好几年都没提过圣诞节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't talked about Christmas in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.93,0:19:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法这么坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can't just sit around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝蛋酒 假装一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}drinking eggnog, pretending everything's okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时心知 明年圣诞节你就不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I know next Christmas you'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you went out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 去给你买晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I had to got you dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘记吃蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget your vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么在枕头下藏枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you keep a gun under your pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱翻我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道为什么我们不论去哪都撒盐圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know why we lay salt down everywhere we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道 闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪拿来的 那是爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that? That's dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你看了会扁你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kick your ass for reading that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怪物是真的吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are monsters real? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了 - 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're crazy. - Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 如果你敢告诉爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, if you ever tell dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了这些 我就灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you any of this, I will end you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.42,0:21:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.02,0:21:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing you have to know is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.93,0:21:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有世上最酷的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have the coolest dad in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸对抗它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad fights them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在就在打怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fighting them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但爸爸说我床下的怪物不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dad said the monsters under my bed weren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.62,0:21:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他已经检查过那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because he'd already checked under there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 它们是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, they're real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎所有怪物都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost everything's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Santa real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:21:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果怪物是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If monsters are real,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就能抓到我们 能抓到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they could get us. They could get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.97,0:22:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸不会允许它们抓到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's not gonna let them get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.72,0:22:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果它们抓到他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if they get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们抓不到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't gonna get dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸是最厉害的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's, like, the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.15,0:22:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在爸爸的日记里读到 它们杀了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read in dad's book that they got mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.45,0:22:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说来话长 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.45,0:22:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它们能杀妈妈 就能杀爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they got mom, they can get dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它们能杀爸爸 就能杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they get dad, they can get us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, dad's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.63,0:22:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸圣诞节会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, dad's gonna be here for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.06,0:22:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like he always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想睡觉 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna go to sleep, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你醒来一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll all be better when you wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.42,0:23:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.28,0:23:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,花环太太就住这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where Mrs. Wreath lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.82,0:23:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 感觉到那股邪恶的异教气息了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, can't you just feel the evil, pagan vibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.58,0:23:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.79,0:23:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我你是玛姬·卡里根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, tell me you're the Madge Carrigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.13,0:23:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绣线菊花环的制作者\N{\fnArial\fs30}who makes the meadowsweet wreaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.67,0:23:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.30,0:23:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bingo. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.51,0:24:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那天在塞勒先生家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we were just admiring your wreaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.22,0:24:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了你的花环 很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Mr. Silar's place the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.39,0:24:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绣线菊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that meadowsweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.43,0:24:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是你闻过的最香的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}just the finest smelling thing you ever smelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is. It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.89,0:24:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题是 你的花环都卖光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But see the problem is that all your wreaths had sold out,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.73,0:24:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们还没来得及买到一个 - 倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- before we got the chance to buy one. - Fudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会还有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't happen to have another one,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.52,0:24:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以买走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we can buy from, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.15,0:24:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.03,0:24:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,本季我只做了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}those were the only ones I had for this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.36,0:24:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.99,0:24:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会决定用绣线菊做花环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you decide to make them out of meadowsweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.74,0:24:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是因为气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, the smell, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我就没闻过那么香的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I've smelled anything finer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.58,0:24:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mentioned that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.62,0:24:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.29,0:24:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是俩好小伙儿来打听我的花环 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just some nice boys, asking about my wreaths, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.58,0:24:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那花环真棒 好花环\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wreaths are fine. Fine wreaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点花生糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care for some peanut brittle?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.22,0:24:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.47,0:24:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.64,0:24:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那俩人非常不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something was off with those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.19,0:24:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.98,0:24:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡里根夫妇去年住在西雅图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Carrigans lived in Seattle last year…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.60,0:24:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节期间 发生了两起绑架案\N{\fnArial\fs30}where two abductions took place, right around Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们1月搬来了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They moved here in January.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.36,0:25:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们家的圣诞节装饰可不是冬青树枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that Christmas crap in their house wasn't boughs of holly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.78,0:25:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是马鞭草和薄荷\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was vervain and mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.32,0:25:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,异教的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pagan stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.20,0:25:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害的异教东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious pagan stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.32,0:25:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 那对看似普通的夫妻把一个异教神\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? Ozzie and Harriett are keeping a pagan god.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在了他们裹着塑料膜的沙发下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}hidden underneath their plastic covered couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.20,0:25:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.54,0:25:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我们该去看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is we gotta check them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.08,0:25:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那鲍比呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.16,0:25:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确定常青木桩能杀了他们 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sure evergreen stakes will kill this thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.42,0:25:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 他确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 塑料膜\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.51,0:26:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.32,0:27:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.78,0:28:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我真希望你们没到下面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, I wish you boys hadn't come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.97,0:28:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.33,0:28:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.75,0:28:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.50,0:28:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他们是神夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess we're dealing with Mr. And Mrs. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.46,0:28:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少知道了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice to know. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还以为你俩懒骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we thought you two lazybones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.42,0:28:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把有趣的部分睡过去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}were gonna sleep straight through all the fun stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.59,0:28:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,错过这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And miss all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.43,0:28:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们喜欢派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're partiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.76,0:28:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他多逗啊 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he a kick in the pants, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.93,0:29:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hunters, is what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你们是异教神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and you're pagan gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就算扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't we just call it even and.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.27,0:29:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,各走各路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}go our separate ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.40,0:29:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 让你带更多猎人回来 杀了我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, so you can bring back more hunters and kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.82,0:29:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.77,0:29:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你吃人之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should have thought that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.86,0:29:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该想到这点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you went snacking on humans then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.53,0:29:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 别那么激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't get all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.86,0:29:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前每年能吃上百个祭品呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, we used to take over a hundred tributes a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.66,0:29:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.83,0:29:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们才吃几个 两三个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what do we take, what, two, three?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.50,0:29:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上这俩侦探小伙儿就五个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardy Boys here make five.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.04,0:29:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's not so bad, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.30,0:29:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么说的话 你们就是模范夫妻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you say it like that, I guess you guys are the Cunninghams.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.51,0:29:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先生 最好对我们放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mister, better show us a little respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.68,0:29:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.18,0:29:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要吃了我们吗 - 还不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll eat us? - Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.35,0:29:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要先遵守一些仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's rituals to be followed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.81,0:29:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非常看重仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just sticklers for ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.39,0:29:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道仪式从什么开始吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what kicks off the whole shebang?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.44,0:29:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 绣线菊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Meadowsweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.61,0:29:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 你们没有花环了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shucks, you're all out of wreaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.27,0:29:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只能取消人祭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll just have to cancel the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么消极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be such a gloomy Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.49,0:29:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.53,0:30:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看上去多可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't they just look darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.95,0:30:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good enough to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.16,0:30:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty-roo,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.29,0:30:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二步\N{\fnArial\fs30}step number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.55,0:30:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.63,0:30:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.51,0:30:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.57,0:30:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.85,0:30:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听他们怎么跟我们说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear how they talk to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.97,0:30:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}To gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.14,0:30:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 伙计 想当年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, pal, back in the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.52,0:30:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有数百万人崇拜我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were worshipped by millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.06,0:30:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,时过境迁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.10,0:30:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.19,0:30:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.27,0:30:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个耶稣成了新红人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus character's the hot, new thing in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间 我们的祭坛被烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, our altars are being burned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.24,0:30:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像普通怪物一样被猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're being hunted down like common monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.32,0:30:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did we say peep?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, we did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.78,0:30:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.62,0:30:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们低调做人 我们找了工作 按揭买房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kept a low profile, we got jobs, a mortgage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个词怎么说的来着 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… What was that word, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.79,0:30:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被同化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We assimilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.67,0:30:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们被同化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we assimilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.67,0:30:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们周二和周五还打桥牌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, we play bridge on Tuesdays and Fridays.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.51,0:30:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.34,0:30:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有你想得融入得那么好 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not blending in as smooth as you think, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:31:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能会有点刺痛 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might pinch a bit, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.18,0:31:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.89,0:31:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.43,0:31:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人该往脏话罐里投五分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody owes a nickel to the swear jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.10,0:31:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我想说脏话时会说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I say when I feel like swearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.98,0:31:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.77,0:31:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽量记住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try and remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.23,0:31:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道你们多么幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys have no idea how lucky you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.03,0:31:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经 孩子们会远道而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time when kids came from miles around,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.32,0:31:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为坐在你们这位置上\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to be sitting where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.78,0:31:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想拿那玩意干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing with those?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.41,0:31:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒霉催的敢再碰我 我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fudging touch me again, I'll fudging kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.95,0:31:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.93,0:31:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.31,0:31:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.03,0:32:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.58,0:32:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.12,0:32:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,指甲 血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingernail, blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.45,0:32:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Peter on a Popsicle stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot the tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.96,0:32:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.09,0:32:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.22,0:32:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,张大嘴 说「啊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open wide and say: Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.23,0:32:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要去开门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody gonna get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.65,0:32:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该去开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.07,0:32:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.95,0:32:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说我闻到了水果蛋糕味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I smelled fruitcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.24,0:32:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.49,0:32:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 我很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite your tongue. It's my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.29,0:32:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去很好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks scrumptious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.33,0:32:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 尼尔和我要去唱颂歌 一起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, Neil and I are going caroling, you care to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.50,0:32:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we would…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.79,0:32:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的后背 烦人的又跟我闹腾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my back. Darn thing's giving me fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.25,0:33:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那圣诞快乐了 - 你也是 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, Merry Christmas. - And to you too, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.72,0:33:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天还打桥牌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we still on for bridge tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.43,0:33:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With bells on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, bye. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.31,0:33:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.29,0:33:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办 常青木桩在地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now? The evergreen stakes are in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.71,0:33:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要另找常青木了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we need more evergreen, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.92,0:33:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just found us some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.46,0:33:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我堵门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.75,0:34:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.83,0:34:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那棵树呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.10,0:34:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madge!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.82,0:35:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸来过了 看他带来了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was here. Look what he brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.28,0:35:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸来过吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad was here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 我们收获好大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. We made a killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.25,0:35:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么不叫醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he try to wake me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.42,0:35:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫了你好久呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to, like, a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.17,0:35:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.59,0:35:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.59,0:35:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说他会跟我们过圣诞节吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I tell you he would give us Christmas or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.38,0:35:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去啊 去拆礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Dive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.28,0:36:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.65,0:36:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝宝石芭比娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sapphire Barbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.66,0:36:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸可能把你当女孩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad probably thinks you're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.41,0:36:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.62,0:36:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.34,0:36:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸没来过 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad never showed, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.84,0:36:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he did. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.88,0:36:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这些东西你哪弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, where did you get all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.59,0:36:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,街区前面的一栋好房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice house up the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.27,0:36:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我不知道那是给女孩的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, I didn't know they were chick presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.07,0:36:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸如果能回来 他肯定会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sure dad would have been here if he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.28,0:36:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.49,0:36:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.16,0:36:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.29,0:37:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.00,0:37:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.50,0:37:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是给爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's for dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.42,0:37:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.72,0:37:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把它给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.06,0:37:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.45,0:37:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sam. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.79,0:37:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.77,0:38:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买啤酒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.48,0:38:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.48,0:38:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.02,0:38:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.07,0:38:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.87,0:38:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.45,0:38:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝蛋酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}try the eggnog.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.45,0:38:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果酒劲不够告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know if it needs some more kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.39,0:38:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用 挺好 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we're good. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.63,0:38:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 那好 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Good. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧 我们过圣诞节吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a seat. Let's do Christmas stuff or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.80,0:38:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 重要的事先做\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, first thing's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.44,0:38:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.61,0:38:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get these?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.32,0:38:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace special.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.90,0:38:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,街那边的加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas mart down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.03,0:39:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.28,0:39:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.62,0:39:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄所见略同 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great minds think alike, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.99,0:39:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.08,0:39:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.66,0:39:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.75,0:39:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.63,0:39:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,色情杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skin mags…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.46,0:39:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.59,0:39:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,剃须膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}shaving cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.67,0:39:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.22,0:39:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.98,0:39:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.10,0:39:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的燃料 宝贝车的燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel for me and fuel for my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.48,0:39:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太棒了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are awesome. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.07,0:39:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.78,0:39:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.70,0:39:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.70,0:39:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.78,0:40:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.29,0:40:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看比赛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel like watching the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.70,0:40:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.62,0:40:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
